  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Добавлена совместимость между анимациями еды и продуктами питания из мода Quark, а также некоторыми вариантами из дополнений на тему Quark.</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Совместимость с пакетами текстур</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animations More Mod Compatibility[NEO/FORGE]</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[FABRIC]</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1751/483/639114741005949896.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></em></a><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animation-more-mod-compatibility-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1748/995/639113051020661900.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"153\"></a></em></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong>Другие совместимости в отдельных частях:</strong></em></span></h3><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-quark-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/885/256/256/639148225207339732.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-aether-compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/866/256/256/639148221311503481.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/873/256/256/639148222209502373.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-farmers-delight-add-ons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/875/256/256/639148223190593815.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1816/879/256/256/639148224173941263.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eating-animations-x-artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1813/752/256/256/639146533871866822.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></a></p><p><strong>Добавьте совместимость с модами, использующими&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eating Animations(NEO/FORGE)</a> и&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eating-animation-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(FABRIC)</a>, или <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modefite-item-definition-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modefite</a></strong></p><h3><strong>Совместимость с модами:</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark Delight</a></strong></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Совместимые версии:</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><strong>1.16.x, </strong><strong>1.18.x,&nbsp;</strong><strong>1.19.x,&nbsp;</strong><strong>1.20.x,&nbsp;</strong><strong>1.21.x</strong></li>\n</ul><p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b9a621b8-993b-4cec-910f-0e04f0d42aaa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"324\" height=\"108\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
